WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.240
Hi, Bayern fans. I'm at Säbener Straße.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.160
Welcome! How are you?

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:17.920
Good. And you?

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:18.680
Good. Great to have you here.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:19.840
Thank you very much.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:22.920
How was the flight?

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.480
Good.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.760
It's my first time in Munich.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.920
Now that I'll be living here,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.080
I'll do my best to enjoy the Munich lifestyle.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.240
I was born in Spain,

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.240
but my parents are Moroccan.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:45.040
And now I've been living in the Netherlands.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.320
So German will be your next challenge?

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.000
Yes, my sixth language.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.560
Do you like it?

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.040
I love it!

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.080
Yeah? Good.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.040
Hi, Bayern fans. I'm at Säbener Straße.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.560
I'm really happy to be here.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.760
These are the changing rooms.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.600
Coaches, staff.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.160
And here's us.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.320
Arijon Ibrahimović sits here.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:46.120
He's a young player from Munich who's back at the club.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.880
And this is where Phonzy and Jamal sit.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.240
This is Ismael.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.440
Welcome. I'm Andrea. Nice to meet you.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.440
Servus, I'm Claudio.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.240
Servus.

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:58.800
These two are from Italy.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.200
So if you like Italian food...

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.440
Great cuisine!

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:04.560
I like Italian food.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.080
We're happy to have you with us now.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.440
Yes, I'm very happy.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.880
Is this your first time in Munich?

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.680
Yes, it's my first time.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.720
Great. Together with your whole family.

